<definition version="0.100.0" type="element" link_type="simple" width="200" height="130" hotspot_x="20" hotspot_y="60">
	<uuid uuid="{872c3763-cf16-56ee-a752-f22ee9090732}"/>
	<names>
		<name lang="en">Murrelektronik 7000-18141-6R52500 Valve plug form BI with LED and suppression PUR 5x0.5, 25 m</name>
		<name lang="fr">Connecteur d'électrovanne forme BI avec LED et protection Murrelektronik 7000-18141-6R52500 PUR 5x0.5, 25 m</name>
	</names>
	<elementInformations>
		<elementInformation name="manufacturer" show="1">Murrelektronik</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference" show="1">7000-18141-6R52500</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">Connecteur d'électrovanne forme BI, 24 V AC/DC, LED et protection, cable PUR 5 x 0.5 mm2 black, 25 m</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">MSUD valve plug form BI (11 mm in the datasheet), 24 V AC +-20 % / DC +-25 %, LED green/yellow and suppression (diode, Zener diode), 4 A per contact max., cut-off peak voltage 55 V, cable PUR 5 x 0.5 mm2 black, 25 m. Source: https://shop.murrelektronik.com/en/Connection-Technology/Valve-Connectors/With-open-ended-wires-oxid/MSUD-valve-plug-A-18mm-with-cable-7000-18141-6R52500.html (the shop title says A-18mm, the text says form BI 11 mm: to check). The internal circuit drawn (LED and resistor in series, in parallel with two anti-series suppression diodes, between the contacts 1 and 2; PE straight through) follows the diagram of the Y distributor datasheet supplied by the user and is assumed for the plug. Function routing: X1 and X2 are the same channel.</elementInformation>
	</elementInformations>
	<informations>Author: QElectroTech contributors
Original vector drawing, not copied from a manufacturer drawing. Ratings and terminal names from the public datasheet; layout and symbols are generic, check them against the datasheet.
License: see http://qelectrotech.org/wiki/doc/elements_license</informations>
